    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="register-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">ERXGSR_EL1</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Selected Error Record Group Status Register</p><div data-pagefind-body="1">
        <p>Shows the status for the records in a group of error records.</p>

      
        <p>Accesses <a href="ext-errgsr.html">ERRGSR</a> for the group of error records &lt;n&gt; selected by <a href="AArch64-errselr_el1.html">ERRSELR_EL1</a>.SEL[15:6].</p>
      </div><h3>Configuration</h3><p>This register is present only when FEAT_RASv2 is implemented. Otherwise, direct accesses to ERXGSR_EL1 are <span class="arm-defined-word">UNDEFINED</span>.</p><h3>Attributes</h3>
        <p>ERXGSR_EL1 is a 64-bit register.</p>
